physics build in this isolated checkout. The dated scaffold remains a research
design; its earlier scaffold-only dispatch language does not revoke this later
build authorization. Every ordinary native prerequisite, source, review, repair,
gate and owner hold remains binding. Do not publish or push. New content remains
draft.

