research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/research-localization-bps.md:40:Two near matches are not interchangeable with BPS interfaces. `def-equivariant-borel-moore-homology-and-correspondence-convolution` is a constructible equivariant BM construction for specified general-linear actions/correspondences, not equivariant de Rham cohomology of compact smooth manifolds. The EM example `physics/items/ex-emgmath-monopole-patch-flux.md` is a fixed-normalization Abelian flux calculation; it is not a non-Abelian Higgs monopole, a BPS solution or a quantum magnetic-charge measurement. Any neural-network item containing “spectral network” is unrelated to the Gaiotto–Moore–Neitzke construction.
