+      locator: "Lecture Notes in Mathematics 2386, Chapter 23, §§23.1.1–23.1.3, §23.2.3.1 Eq. (23.7), and §§23.3.1.1–23.3.1.4: type-A class-S data, finite webs, relative charges, bulk and framed-index conventions, and the fermion-number sign ambiguity."
